# Allow-list: the image needs only the Go sources, the healthcheck helper and the static frontend.
# Everything else (.git, docs, tests and their node_modules, deploy/.env with secrets, backups) stays out.
# A new top-level frontend file or directory has to be added here to reach the image.
*

!server/
!deploy/healthcheck/

!index.html
!landing.html
!privacy.html
!app.js
!bus.js
!scenarios.js
!xbot.js
!features/
!assets/

# never, even inside allowed directories
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/*_test.go
**/.DS_Store
